# ======= 通用人机验证与身份鉴权规则 =======
# Cloudflare Turnstile 5秒盾
HOST-SUFFIX, challenges.cloudflare.com, Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX, cfl.re, Anthropic

# hCaptcha 人机验证
HOST-SUFFIX, hcaptcha.com, Anthropic

# Arkose Labs / FunCaptcha (OpenAI / GitHub 旋转验证码)
HOST-SUFFIX, arkoselabs.com, Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX, funcaptcha.com, Anthropic

# Google reCAPTCHA 验证码
HOST-SUFFIX, recaptcha.net, Anthropic
HOST-KEYWORD, recaptcha, Anthropic

# Auth0 & Okta 单点登录鉴权服务
HOST-SUFFIX, auth0.com, Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX, okta.com, Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX, oktacdn.com, Anthropic
